l,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"269b6f608bb04eeeabd7621140f23136","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008574474926146509,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb3a759efdd2548214c0a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142567920,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb3a059efdd2548214be3","chatId":"bb295f07dbd948ef9518adc0d4d890b3","sessionId":null,"userId":129547,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"嗯，能感觉到你开口前会先被爸妈的眼光牵住，这让你很难把自己的心思放前面。先不急着决定该不该，我想知道：如果暂时不管他们怎么看，你自己最想说的那句话是什么？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"嗯，能感觉到你开口前会先被爸妈的眼光牵住，这让你很难把自己的心思放前面。先不急着决定该不该，我想知道：如果暂时不管他们怎么看，你自己最想说的那句话是什么？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2983,"promptTokens":154,"completionTokens":249,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:40"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"5926f9f642e34b039c51ef3c15964074","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00857440574585643,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb3a059efdd2548214be2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795142560564,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:42:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb3a059efdd2548214be2","chatId":"bb295f07dbd948ef9518adc0d4d890b3","sessionId":null,"userId":129547,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（点点头）嗯。而且我一想到要开口，就又会想到爸妈，觉得我是不是不该把心思放这上面。（叹气）在我家，什么事都得先想他们怎么看。<第11轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复